2026-07-23, with the release-candidate packaging updated on 2026-07-24.
The modifications package World Monitor as an all-in-one Unraid container and
include container orchestration, an internal Valkey service and REST adapter,
optional AIS relay handling, scheduled seeders, health checks, security
hardening, source-link rewriting, Unraid metadata, tests, documentation, and
release automation.

